5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry less about the bins and more about if we can still talk to each other after this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see everyone. I just hope we find a way that keeps our mornings peaceful.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know the exact time cost. I refuse to let this rest on whoever answers the phone first.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why does one house always get the smell? I want a plan that is actually fair for all of us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must look at the numbers. Who pays for the setup, and what does this corner cost us yearly?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, you are right. If it feels unfair, we will stop knocking on doors. Let's check the logs.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. Peace is important. I will look into what the neighbours actually said at the meeting.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the budget is part of the time cost. I will check the ward subsidy and the shelter costs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I will check the complaint log. I want to see who is complaining the most.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, good. I will check the block ledger. We need to know the real yearly expense.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the residents' meeting statements. I want to know who is willing to help.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check the station block's minutes. I want to see how their arrangement turned out.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the truck arrival time. I need to know when the window actually starts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the measurements of the frontages. I want to see if the space is even equal.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the ward filing requirements. I need to know how long a permanent build takes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's see what we find. I hope it helps us stay friends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am sure we will find a gentle solution. Thank you all for listening.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Logic will guide us. Let's proceed with the investigation.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I can't wait to see the data. Let's make it fair!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from knowing the facts. Let us begin.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
