35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the log shows one house filed eleven complaints. That explains the tension.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I see. The station block argued over sweeping within two years. We must be careful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The truck comes at seven forty. A strict window means waking up before dawn. That is a heavy burden.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, yes. And the frontages are uneven. One house has a driveway, another is tiny. Rotation is hard.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra costs. And a permanent build takes four months.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if the window is too tight, people will hate each other. I fear Option C.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, four months is a long time to wait. And the station block's experience worries me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, I agree. The time cost is too high for a narrow window. It wears people down.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, the station block's minutes show they fought over the latch. I don't want that here.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the subsidy covers forty percent, but the setup is still significant. We must weigh the cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if we rotate, the house with the driveway might struggle. Is it fair?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, perhaps. But an enclosed structure might smell worse in summer, as the station block found.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the station block's bin house smelled worse by midsummer. An enclosure is a bad idea.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree. The smell is a daily annoyance. I prefer a solution that doesn't trap it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the ledger shows the costs come from open bags. Supervision might reduce that, but who supervises?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, nobody volunteered to supervise. That is the problem. We need a system that works without heroes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I think we need to look at the options carefully. Let's wait for the list.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will wait for the options. I need to see the full picture before deciding.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am ready. Let's see what the ward offers.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see the options. We will choose wisely.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
