60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, Option C requires supervision. But nobody wants to do it. It will cause fights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. The station block's experience with the latch shows how quickly things go wrong.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is expensive and takes four months. Option C is a time trap. Option B is the only logical choice.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but Option B is hard with uneven frontages. One house has a driveway. Is it fair?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, fairness is relative. But Option A's cost and time are prohibitive. Option C's burden is too heavy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if we rotate, we can adjust the intervals. Maybe the house with the driveway gets a shorter turn.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that sounds reasonable. We can be flexible. I hope we can keep the peace.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, flexibility is good. But we need a clear rule. I will support Option B if we can manage the rotation.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I will support Option B too. It is better than trapping the smell or waking up early.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, I agree. Option B is the most balanced. It shares the burden, even if imperfectly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I am glad we agree. I hope this keeps us talking.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I am sure it will. Let's vote for Option B.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Option B. It is the most logical and sustainable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for Option B. It is fairer than the others.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for Option B. It is the wisest choice for our community.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"Let's hope it works. I will knock on your doors, I promise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I will smile and wave. Let's make this work together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will monitor the time cost. Let's see how it goes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I will check the rotation. Let's make it fair!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with wisdom and care.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
